==Notes==
* All [[class]]es except [[monk]]s, [[pale master]]s, [[purple dragon knight]]s, [[red dragon disciple]]s, [[shifter]]s, [[sorcerer]]s, [[weapon master]]s and [[wizard]]s receive this feat for free.

==Builder notes==
'''Item feat:''' yes

*Adding this feat to [[armor]] is pointless; it will not have an effect. Armor (not counting robes) can only be equipped by a character who already has this feat.
*Armor with base [[armor class|AC]] from 1 to 3 counts as light armor and requires this feat to equip.

==Custom content notes==
'''Removable:''' yes

'''Reusable:''' yes

'''Script:''' [[hardcoded]]

*Removing this feat from the game will not remove the hardcoded requirement for equipping light armor.